      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Deploy: one container image (Fly.io / Cloud Run), managed Postgres + Redis\nRate limit per user before calling the model or cal.com (cal.com: 120/min per key)\nEvery write carries its change id; the same id never writes twice\nEvals: scripted chats against a test cal.com account, run before each deploy",
